"""The tagStandard41h12 codebook: what each tag id looks like when printed.

The bit patterns are a property of the tag family, not of whichever command
happens to draw them. Two commands need them and used to reach for the same
copy: ``generate-apriltags`` lays out the printable PDFs, and
``render-apriltag-textures`` renders the PNGs the simulated scene wears. One
imported the other to get at them, which is what put ``py/scripts`` on
``sys.path``.

Kept beside the tag ids in :mod:`pick_and_place.spec.workspace`, which say
*which* tags the cube and the workspace frame carry; this says what those tags
are.
"""

from __future__ import annotations

